@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@apiVersion = 1.0
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..u6PJ5Gz83cbL4JkXp2t9Fo0VFC6xhT13qtGJM6ekKSA

### 1. Get Today's Work Order Analytics (Default Timezone: Africa/Cairo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Get Work Order Analytics for a Specific Target Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/dashboard/stats?date=2026-09-14&timeZoneId=Africa/Cairo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get Paginated Audit Logs (Manager Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Filter Audit Logs by Table Name and Action Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/audit-logs?tableName=Customers&actionType=Modified&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Filter Audit Logs by User and Date Range
@userId = 19a59129-6c20-417a-834d-11a208d32d96
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/audit-logs?userId={{userId}}&fromDate=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&toDate=2026-09-14T23:59:59Z&page=1&pageSize=15
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}